NullDC4Wii - Alpha 0.04
=======================

Github :

https://github.com/BenoitAdam94/nullDC4Wii

Install :
=========

Runs from SD or from USB - the app finds its files relative to the folder
boot.dol was launched from.

BIOS :
======

Wii, SD install :
SD:/apps/nullDC4wii/data/

Wii, USB install :
USB:/apps/nullDC4wii/data/

Dolphin :
SD:/data/


Game files :
============

Put your games in SD:/discs or USB:/dreamcast
(either folder name works on either device; press 2 to switch device)

